   PUBMED   25863307
  REMARK    GeneRIF: Progressive pathological aortic root enlargement as the
            result of degeneration of microfibril architecture and
            consequential loss of extracellular matrix integrity due to
            fibrillin-1 (FBN1) mutations are commonly diagnosed clinical
            manifestations of MFS.
